:: Deadwood Robin Doctor Widgets [widget]
<<widget 'deadwood-robin-doctor-room-links'>>
  <<if C.npc.Robin.init is 1 and $robinmissing is 0 and $RobinExpansion.asylum.status isnot 'admitted'
    and $robin.timer.hurt is 0 and getRobinLocation() is 'orphanage'
    and C.npc.Robin.dom gte 40 and C.npc.Robin.trauma lt 50
    and Time.hour gte 19 and Time.hour lte 22
    and $RobinExpansion.doctor.day isnot Time.days>>
    <<if $RobinExpansion.doctor.stage gte 2>>
      <<loveicon>><<lanLink ['Let Robin talk you into a game (0:30)', '由着罗宾拉着你玩那个游戏 (0:30)'] 'Deadwood Robin Doctor Invite'>><</lanLink>><br>
      <<icon 'medicine/tablet-information.png'>><<lanLink ['Let Robin be the doctor (0:30)', '让罗宾来当医生 (0:30)'] 'Deadwood Robin Doctor Reversed'>><</lanLink>><br>
    <<else>>
      <<icon 'medicine/tablet-information.png'>><<lanLink ['Teach Robin a game you know (0:30)', '教罗宾一个你会的游戏 (0:30)'] 'Deadwood Robin Doctor Invite'>><</lanLink>><br>
    <</if>>
  <</if>>
<</widget>>

<<widget 'deadwood-robin-doctor-log'>>
  <<set _d to $RobinExpansion.doctor>>
  <<set _doctorCompleted to false>>
  <<if _d.active and !$statFreeze and !$replayScene>>
    <<set _d.active to false>>
    <<set _doctorCompleted to true>>
    <<set _d.count += 1>>
    <<set _d.stage to Math.min(2, _d.count)>>
    <<pass 5>>
  <</if>>
<</widget>>

:: Deadwood Robin Doctor Invite
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'home'>><<effects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<if $RobinExpansion.doctor.day isnot Time.days and !$statFreeze and !$replayScene>>
  <<set $RobinExpansion.doctor.day to Time.days>>
  <<set $RobinExpansion.doctor.active to false>>
  <<pass 30>>
<</if>>
<<if $RobinExpansion.doctor.stage gte 2>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Robin is already on the bed when you come in, book shut, arms folded behind <<his>> head. "Took you long enough," <<he>> says.
      <br><br>
      <span class='lewd'>"Play doctor with me."</span> <<he>> says it the way <<he>>'d ask you to pass the salt, and <<he>> is already undoing <<his>> own shirt buttons with one hand, unhurried. "You are the doctor. I will be the patient who is very brave about it."
      <br><br>
      <<he>> stretches out flat and lets <<his>> knees fall apart, entirely on purpose. "Go on then, doctor. Examine me."
      <br><br>
      <<if C.npc.Robin.lust gte 70 and C.npc.Robin.penis isnot 'none'>>
        <span class='lewd'><<he>> is already straining against <<his>> trousers before you have touched <<him>>, and <<he>> knows you can see it.</span> Robin grins up at you, no shame in it at all. "What? You are the one who taught me this game."
      <<else>>
        Robin watches you with <<his>> mouth a little open, waiting to see whether you will take the bait.
      <</if>>
    <<option 'CN'>>
      你进门时罗宾已经躺在床上了，书合着，两手枕在脑后。“才来啊。”<<he>>说。
      <br><br>
      <span class='lewd'>“陪我玩医生游戏。”</span><<he>>说得像让你递盐一样随便，一边不急不慢地单手解自己的衬衫扣子。“你当医生。我当那个特别勇敢的病人。”
      <br><br>
      <<he>>摊平躺好，故意把两边膝盖分开。“来吧医生，检查我。”
      <br><br>
      <<if C.npc.Robin.lust gte 70 and C.npc.Robin.penis isnot 'none'>>
        <span class='lewd'>你还没碰到<<he>>，裤子底下就已经支起来了，而<<he>>知道你看得见。</span>罗宾仰头冲你笑，一点都不害臊。“怎么？这游戏不还是你教我的。”
      <<else>>
        罗宾微微张着嘴看你，等你上不上钩。
      <</if>>
  <</language>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      You sit down on the edge of Robin's bed. "Have you played doctor before?"
      <br><br>
      Robin shakes <<his>> head slowly, working out whether this is a joke. So you explain it to <<him>> — the orphans play it, one person is the doctor, the other lies down and does whatever the doctor says.
      <br><br>
      "And the doctor just... looks?" Robin asks. You tell <<him>> the doctor checks things, and that <<he>> will understand once <<he>> is on <<his>> back.
      <br><br>
      <<if C.npc.Robin.trauma gte 30>>
        Robin glances at the door before lying down. "Door stays open," <<he>> says, and then <<he>> unbuttons <<his>> own shirt, one button at a time, watching your hands the whole way.
      <<else>>
        Robin lies back with a nervous laugh. "Fine. But you had better know what you are doing." <<he>> gets <<his>> own shirt off before you ask, then <span class='pink'>turns red about it</span> — which seems to embarrass <<him>> more than being undressed would have.
      <</if>>
      <br><br>
      <<if C.npc.Robin.penis isnot 'none'>><span class='lewd'>The moment your palm lands on bare skin, <<his>> stomach flinches and <<he>> forgets to breathe. <<He>> is already half hard and there is nothing on <<him>> to hide it behind.</span><<else>>Robin watches you, waiting for you to decide whether to continue.<</if>> You do not say anything about it yet. That is half the game.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      你在罗宾床边坐下。“你以前玩过医生游戏吗？”
      <br><br>
      罗宾慢慢摇头，在判断这是不是个玩笑。于是你给<<he>>讲——孤儿院的孩子玩这个，一个人当医生，另一个躺下，医生说什么就做什么。
      <br><br>
      “那医生就……只是看看？”罗宾问。你说医生会检查一些东西，等<<he>>躺下来就知道了。
      <br><br>
      <<if C.npc.Robin.trauma gte 30>>
        罗宾躺下前先看了眼门。“门开着。”<<he>>说，然后自己动手解衬衫，一颗一颗，眼睛一直盯着你的手。
      <<else>>
        罗宾带着紧张的笑躺下去。“行。可你最好知道自己在干嘛。”没等你开口<<he>>就自己把衬衫脱了，随即<span class='pink'>脸红起来</span>——对<<he>>来说这比被脱光还难受。
      <</if>>
      <br><br>
      <<if C.npc.Robin.penis isnot 'none'>><span class='lewd'>你的手掌一落到皮肤上，<<he>>肚子就缩了一下，连呼吸都忘了。<<he>>已经半硬了，身上没东西挡得住。</span><<else>>罗宾看着你，等你决定要不要继续。<</if>>你暂时什么都不说。这也是游戏的一半。
  <</language>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<lanLink ['Begin the check-up', '开始检查'] 'Deadwood Robin Doctor Game'>><</lanLink>>
<br><<lanLink ['Change your mind', '算了'] 'Deadwood Robin Doctor Refuse'>><</lanLink>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Leave Robin be', '让罗宾待着'] 'Orphanage'>><<endevent>><</lanLink>>

:: Deadwood Robin Doctor Game
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'home'>><<effects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    You do it properly. Ear flat to <<his>> chest first — <<his>> heart is going far too fast for a routine check-up. Then a palm spread on <<his>> stomach, feeling <<him>> breathe.
    <br><br>
    <span class='lewd'>Then lower, straight past the waistband, no pretending about it. Robin's breath jams in <<his>> throat, but <<he>> does not stop you. <<He>> lifts <<his>> hips to help you get the clothes out of the way, which is not a thing patients do.</span>
    <br><br>
    <<if C.npc.Robin.penis isnot 'none'>>
      <<if $RobinExpansion.doctor.stage gte 2>>
        <span class='lewd'><<he>> is hard before you get a hand on it, and <<he>> watches your face the whole time you take hold, hunting for a reaction.</span> "Careful, doctor," Robin says, and rolls <<his>> hips up into your fist to make <<his>> point. <span class='lewd'>"I think it might be serious."</span>
      <<elseif C.npc.Robin.trauma gte 30>>
        <span class='lewd'>Half hard and twitching against <<his>> own thigh, eyes fixed on the ceiling, one hand braced flat on the mattress — but <<his>> legs have gone slack and open anyway.</span> "This is part of it?" Robin asks. You say yes. Believing you is the hard part, and <<he>> does it.
      <<else>>
        <span class='lewd'><<he>> is stiff in your hand before you finish the sentence,</span> and <<he>> laughs, breathless and wobbly. "This is a weird game," Robin says. Nothing in <<his>> voice says stop.
      <</if>>
    <<else>>
      Robin watches your hands and waits for you to decide whether to continue.
    <</if>>
    <br><br>
    You get a knee between <<his>> thighs and push them wider, then lean in the way a doctor leans in when <<he>> has found the problem.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    你按正经流程来。先把耳朵贴在<<his>>胸口——那颗心跳得完全不像在做常规检查。然后手掌按在肚子上，感觉<<he>>吸气。
    <br><br>
    <span class='lewd'>再往下，越过裤腰，一点也没打算绕弯子。罗宾的呼吸卡在喉咙里，但没拦你。<<he>>抬腰帮你把衣服挪开——病人不会这样。</span>
    <br><br>
    <<if C.npc.Robin.penis isnot 'none'>>
      <<if $RobinExpansion.doctor.stage gte 2>>
        <span class='lewd'>你还没碰到，它就已经硬了。你握住的时候<<he>>一直看你的脸，在找反应。</span>“小心点，医生。”罗宾说，一边把腰顶进你手里，<span class='lewd'>“我觉得这病可能挺严重。”</span>
      <<elseif C.npc.Robin.trauma gte 30>>
        <span class='lewd'>半硬着贴在大腿上一跳一跳，眼睛盯着天花板，一只手按在床垫上撑着——两条腿却已经松软地张开了。</span>“这也是检查的一部分？”罗宾问。你说对。信你对<<he>>来说最难，可<<he>>还是信了。
      <<else>>
        <span class='lewd'>你话还没说完它就在你手里硬了，</span>罗宾笑出声，气都不匀。“这游戏真怪。”语气里没有半点要停的意思。
      <</if>>
    <<else>>
      罗宾看着你的手，等你决定要不要继续。
    <</if>>
    <br><br>
    你用膝盖顶进<<his>>两腿之间，把它们推得更开，然后俯下身去，像个终于找到病灶的医生。
<</language>>
<br><br>
<<lanLink ['Keep going', '继续下去'] 'Deadwood Robin Doctor Sex'>>
  <<set $sexstart to 1>>
<</lanLink>>
<<promiscuous3>>
<br>
<<lanLink ['Stop here', '就到这里'] 'Deadwood Robin Doctor Refuse'>><</lanLink>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Leave Robin be', '让罗宾待着'] 'Orphanage'>><<endevent>><</lanLink>>

:: Deadwood Robin Doctor Sex
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'home'>><<effects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<if $sexstart is 1>>
  <<set $sexstart to 0>>
  <<set $RobinExpansion.doctor.active to true>>
  <<clearnpc>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
  <<run statusCheck('Robin')>>
  <<consensual>><<set $consensual to 1>><<neutral 1>>
  <<maninit>><<set $enemytrust += 500>>
  <<set $enemyarousalmax to 600>>
  <<npcexpose>>
  <<if $RobinExpansion.doctor.stage gte 2>>
    <<lanSwitch '"About time," Robin says, and <span class="lewd">hooks a leg over your hip to pull you down onto <<him>>. The game is over and neither of you minds.</span>' '“可算来了。”罗宾说着，<span class="lewd">一条腿勾上你的腰，把你拉下来贴住自己。游戏到此为止，两个人都无所谓。</span>'>>
  <<else>>
    <<lanSwitch '<span class="lewd">Robin waits for the next instruction with <<his>> thighs already shaking,</span> and does exactly what you tell <<him>>, every time.' '<span class="lewd">罗宾大腿已经在抖了，</span>却还是等着你的下一个指令，你说什么<<he>>做什么。'>>
  <</if>>
  <<if C.npc.Robin.trauma gte 30>>
    <<lanSwitch 'One hand stays braced on the wall the whole way, but <<he>> never once asks you to stop.' '<<he>>一只手始终撑在墙上，却一次也没让你停。'>>
  <</if>>
  <br><br>
  <<lanSwitch 'Between rounds you check on <<him>>, and Robin is always already looking back, chin up, waiting for you to say whether the game is still on.' '每轮之间你看<<he>>一眼，罗宾总是已经抬着下巴在回望你，等着你开口说这局还没完。'>>
  <br><br>
  <<promiscuous3>>
  <br><br>
<</if>>
<<set $enemyanger to 0>>
<<effects>><<effectsman>><<man>><<stateman>>
<br><br><<actionsman>>
<<if _combatend or $consensual isnot 1>>
  <span id='next'><<lanLink ["Next","继续"] 'Deadwood Robin Doctor Sex Finish'>><</lanLink>></span><<nexttext>>
<<else>>
  <span id='next'><<lanLink ["Next","继续"] 'Deadwood Robin Doctor Sex'>><</lanLink>></span><<nexttext>>
<</if>>

:: Deadwood Robin Doctor Sex Finish
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'home'>><<effects>>
<<deadwood-robin-doctor-log>>
<<if _doctorCompleted>><<set $combat to 0>><<clotheson>><</if>>
<<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<if $RobinExpansion.doctor.stage gte 2>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Robin does not move except to breathe. One arm rests over <<his>> eyes while <<he>> catches <<his>> breath.
      <br><br>
      "You always start it the same way," <<he>> says at last. "Ear, stomach, and then straight for it. Every single time."
      <br><br>
      <<he>> rolls onto <<his>> side to look at you, still flushed, still catching <<his>> breath. "Next time I want to be the doctor. I have already decided where I would start."
    <<option 'CN'>>
      事后罗宾除了喘气一动没动。罗宾把一条手臂搭在眼睛上，慢慢平复呼吸。
      <br><br>
      “你每次都这么开头。”<<he>>终于说。“先胸口，再肚子，然后就直奔主题。一次都没变过。”
      <br><br>
      <<he>>翻身侧过来看你，脸还红着，气还没喘匀。“下次换我当医生。我已经想好从哪儿开始了。”
  <</language>>
  <<if _doctorCompleted>><span class='green'><<npcincr Robin love 3>><<npcincr Robin dom 2>><<npcincr Robin trauma -2>></span><<glove>><</if>>
<<elseif C.npc.Robin.trauma gte 30>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Robin pulls the blanket up and thanks you in a small voice. It takes <<him>> a while to look at you again — but <<he>> does, and when <<he>> does there is something new in it, badly hidden.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      罗宾把毯子拉到身上，小声道了谢。<<he>>过一会儿才敢重新看你——但<<he>>还是看了，而且眼神里多了点新东西，藏得很潦草。
  <</language>>
  <<if _doctorCompleted>><span class='green'><<npcincr Robin love 1>><<npcincr Robin trauma -1>></span><<glove>><</if>>
<<else>>
  <<lanSwitch 'Robin laughs at the ceiling, still out of breath, and tells you that you make a terrible doctor and that <<he>> would like you to keep practising on <<him>>.' '罗宾对着天花板笑，气还没喘匀，说你这医生当得很差劲，还让你多在<<his>>身上练练。'>>
  <<if _doctorCompleted>><span class='green'><<npcincr Robin love 2>><<npcincr Robin dom 1>></span><<glove>><</if>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Let Robin rest', '让罗宾歇着'] 'Orphanage'>><<endevent>><</lanLink>>
<br>

