<<if $RobinExpansion.doctor.stage gte 2>>
  <<lanSwitch 'You let it go, and Robin does not bother hiding the disappointment. <span class="lewd"><<he>> adjusts <<himself>> through <<his>> trousers without any ceremony at all,</span> and tells you <<he>> will be here tomorrow.' '你不再提了，罗宾也没打算掩饰失望。<span class="lewd"><<he>>隔着裤子把自己整理了一下，一点也不避讳，</span>然后说明晚<<he>>还在这儿。'>>
<<else>>
  <<lanSwitch 'You let it go. Robin looks relieved, and a little disappointed, and does not say which one it is.' '你不再提了。罗宾看上去松了口气，又有点失落，自己也说不清是哪一种。'>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Leave Robin be', '让罗宾待着'] 'Orphanage'>><<endevent>><</lanLink>>
